overview:
This MCP Server is built through the Qianfan [AppBuilder Platform](https://console.bce.baidu.com/ai_apaas/personalSpace/component). The platform supports free creation of various capability tools through workflows and automatically publishes them as MCP Servers. Welcome to experience it!

### Service Introduction
312

### Configuration Parameters
```json
{
    "mcpServers": {
        "a_31212": {
            "url": "http://appbuilder.baidu.com/v2/mcp/components/c-wf-5ff7bfb9-4f62-4d24-812f-b04c5dfbd4ea/version/2/sse?api_key=AppBuilder API Key"
        }
    }
}
```
### Authentication Parameter Acquisition
[Click to obtain](https://console.bce.baidu.com/iam/#/iam/apikey/list) authentication parameters. After obtaining them, return to this page and fill them into the configuration parameters.
